source: crates/franken-node/tests/cli_subcommand_goldens.rs
---
Compatibility verification across runtimes

Usage: franken-node verify <COMMAND>

Commands:
  module            Verify a crate-src module contract (not a guest JS module)
  migration         Verify migration compatibility contract output
  compatibility     Probe node, bun, or franken-node; profile names fail closed
  corpus            Verify corpus schema and coverage contract output
  lockstep          Compare behavior across runtimes in lockstep
  release           Verify release artifact signatures and checksums
  transparency-log  Verify transparency log auditability and hash chain integrity
  recovery-runbook  Generate recovery runbook for RCH validation failures
  help              Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
